# Tracked artifacts: the canonical trained DQN and one reference benchmark
# session (7 agents x 20 episodes, charts included), so the paper's numbers
# are reproducible straight from a fresh clone. Everything else stays local.
!models/dqn_default.pt
!data/benchmarks/
data/benchmarks/*
!data/benchmarks/cli-20261019-031440-dc8b/
!data/benchmarks/tournament-20261019-031444-8f73/

